Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,AI AGENTS ARE RUNNING CODE ON REAL SYSTEMS.\NA SINGLE BAD COMMAND CAN DELETE DATA, LEAK SECRETS, OR MOVE MONEY.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,PROMPT INSTRUCTIONS CANNOT RELIABLY STOP THAT.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,CUSTODIAN IS A SAFETY KERNEL BETWEEN AI AGENTS\NAND THE TOOLS THEY USE.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.00,0:00:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,IT EVALUATES EVERY ACTION BEFORE IT REACHES THE SYSTEM.\NTHE AGENT PROPOSES. CUSTODIAN DECIDES.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.00,0:00:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A READ-ONLY INSPECTION: ALLOW.\NA PRODUCTION TOUCH: APPROVAL_REQUIRED.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.00,0:01:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A DESTRUCTIVE COMMAND: DENIED BEFORE EXECUTION.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.00,0:01:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,EVERY DECISION IS RECORDED IN AN HMAC\NHASH-CHAINED AUDIT LOG.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.00,0:01:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,CUSTODIAN IS AGENT-INDEPENDENT.\NENFORCEMENT AT THE TOOL BOUNDARY.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.00,0:01:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,SAME PROTECTION WORKS ACROSS CODING AGENTS,\NINFRASTRUCTURE AGENTS, AND CREDENTIAL BROKERS.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.00,0:02:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,CODEX + GPT-5.6 DURING OPENAI BUILD WEEK.\NCODEX: POLICY BRIDGE, MCP SERVER, 7 TEST FILES.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.00,0:02:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,GPT-5.6: CONTEXTUAL RISK ANALYSIS.\NDETERMINISTIC RULES: FINAL CONTROL.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.00,0:02:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,THE SAME SCENARIOS ARE COVERED\NBY AUTOMATED TESTS.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.00,0:02:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,EVERY DECISION IS AUDITABLE,\NCRYPTOGRAPHICALLY CHAINED, AND CANNOT BE FORGED.
